--!strict
-- Every creature an egg can hatch, in seven rarity tiers from Common to Godly.
-- coinsPerSecond is before rebirth and pass multipliers. Income per floor
-- spot rises with every tier (an Epic takes 2 spots, a Legendary or Godly 3:
-- Epic 190-260, Legendary 450-700, Godly 800-1000, Nov 7) and tops out at
-- 1,000/s, so a coin pack stays worth minutes of play even to a lucky
-- player (tests/Config.spec checks it). mountSpeed is the walk
-- speed (studs per second) while riding it; a player on foot walks at 16, and
-- rarer creatures ride faster. How each one looks (voxel model, size, glow,
-- animation) is in src/shared/VoxelArt, built from tools/art.
--
-- pools: { "All" } for every creature. Every egg hatches every creature of
-- the tiers it rolls (Alex, Nov 12), so eggs differ only by their tier odds.
-- An egg rolls a tier first, then a creature from that tier, so adding a
-- creature only splits its own tier's share: no other tier's chance moves.
-- weight: its share inside its tier and pool, 1 when left out.
-- element: Ember, Glacial, Nature or Storm, or none. No effect yet:
-- elements roll out once the roster is several hundred creatures.
